VERSION 2

DESCRIPTION >
  Shamiri: legacy user-agent lookup. The app calls get_useragent_per_view__v2
  as a fallback when __v3 (pm_click_events) has no rows for a view. The
  original v2 definition was lost with the old workspace; this reads the same
  fields from page_views__v3 so the fallback returns rows (or cleanly zero)
  instead of a 404 that breaks visit exports.

NODE endpoint
SQL >
    %
    SELECT
        country,
        city,
        browser,
        os,
        device
    FROM
        page_views__v3
    WHERE
        documentId = {{ String(documentId, required=True) }}
        AND viewId = {{ String(viewId, required=True) }}
        AND time >= {{ Int64(since, required=True) }}
    LIMIT 1
